{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111340","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1311134001:1":{"text":"这里曾是我的起居室。我已经不用阖眼，杀死我的疾病，也杀死了我的安眠。","source_cn":"这里曾是我的起居室。我已经不用阖眼，杀死我的疾病，也杀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBCAA8542977BA65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311134002:1":{"text":"亚莲娜，她与我患的是同一种病。所以我知道她无药可医。","source_cn":"亚莲娜，她与我患的是同一种病。所以我知道她无药可医。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9783A953F020B9BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311134003:1":{"text":"你们见到的那个人——无论她是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","source_cn":"你们见到的那个人——无论她是谁，都不是亚莲娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2135626E2168C48F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311134004:1":{"text":"我听管家烛台说，你和大公是同一家族的？","source_cn":"我听管家烛台说，你和大公是同一家族的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207D3CAB2B1EB659","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311134005:1":{"text":"啊，是的。这也是他会来求我的原因。他是我伯父的后裔，也是我的后辈。","source_cn":"啊，是的。这也是他会来求我的原因。他是我伯父的后裔，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A0E76CE1A86E06A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"",